 1. Problem Setup
 Login system has:
Username field
Password field
Submit button
 Goal: when user clicks submit → validate login
 2. Event Loop Model
易 Idea
 System continuously checks for events
 Pseudo-code (C++ style)
⚠ Key Point
System keeps polling for events
Hard to manage for complex UI
 3. Notification (Callback) Model
易 Idea
while(true) {
    event = getEvent();
    if(event.type == CLICK && event.target == SUBMIT_BUTTON) {
        string user = getUsername();
        string pass = getPassword();
        validate(user, pass);
    }
}
